[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7658.39, "timestamp": "02:07:38", "text": "我相信这些命令会起作用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7661.189, "timestamp": "02:07:41", "text": "现在，如果你要……如果有人……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7664.629, "timestamp": "02:07:44", "text": "测试一下。我觉得让我再说一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7672.79, "timestamp": "02:07:52", "text": "名字笑话表演，但没有那个东西。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7676.709, "timestamp": "02:07:56", "text": "以为它打破了大写字母 B、大写字母 T，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7679.27, "timestamp": "02:07:59", "text": "把这个大写"}]